{{ModBox}}
'''Mischief''' is a precept [[mod]] for the {{Companion|Smeeta Kavat}} that allows it to become [[invisible]] while a decoy Kavat draws fire by running toward the enemy. The decoy has a chance to evade damage and upon death it releases a radial {{D|Blind}}.

